      "height": 46.875,
      "text": "Each container’s port comes from its own\npackage.json “mfe” block, so adding an\nexample is a one-file change in it.",
      "originalText": "Each container’s port comes from its own\npackage.json “mfe” block, so adding an\nexample is a one-file change in it.",
